      "text": "->Characters must always be enclosed within single quotes ' '.\n->whenever we use varchar we must tell size .\n->SIZE : it is used to specify number of characters it can store .\n            ->THe maximum numner of chracters that we can store is 2000ch",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "->Characters must always be enclosed within single quotes ' '.\n->whenever we use varchar we must tell size .\n->SIZE : it is used to specify number of characters it can store .\n            ->THe maximum numner of chracters that we can store is 2000ch",
