      "text": "4)-PRIMARY KEY-    IT is constraint which is used to identify a record \n                    Uniquely from the table.  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4)-PRIMARY KEY-    IT is constraint which is used to identify a record \n                    Uniquely from the table.  ",
