      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) FOREIGN KEY : IT is used to establish a connection between the TABLES.  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) FOREIGN KEY : IT is used to establish a connection between the TABLES.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5dg44U4AqnhcNABGEULNZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10278.078902929403,
      "y": 1550.1881337986447,
      "width": 1247.3994140625,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1069308620,
      "version": 388,
      "versionNonce": 1201088244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782229189888,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Characteristics of Foreign Key :- \n1)-WE can have multiple foreign key in a table.\n2)-FK can accept duplicates/ repeated values .\n3)-FK can accept NULL.\n4)-FK is not a combination of UNIQUE and NOT NULL constraints.\n\n5)-For an attribute (column) to become an FK , it is mandatory \n    That it must be an PK in its own table .  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Characteristics of Foreign Key :- \n1)-WE can have multiple foreign key in a table.\n2)-FK can accept duplicates/ repeated values .\n3)-FK can accept NULL.\n4)-FK is not a combination of UNIQUE and NOT NULL constraints.\n\n5)-For an attribute (column) to become an FK , it is mandatory \n    That it must be an PK in its own table .  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
