      "updated": 1782316509259,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Charecteristics of NULL:-\n->null does not represent 0 or SPACE\n->Any operation performed on NULL will result in NULL itself .\n->NULL does not Occupy memory .\n->We cannot equate NULL .\n\n\n\n \n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Charecteristics of NULL:-\n->null does not represent 0 or SPACE\n->Any operation performed on NULL will result in NULL itself .\n->NULL does not Occupy memory .\n->We cannot equate NULL .\n\n\n\n \n",
