      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782489377171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> We can use multiple columns as an argument to distinct \n    clause, it will remove the combination of columns in which \n    THE RECORDS ARE DUPLICATED",
