      "updated": 1782919624858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Operators in SQL \n\n1)- Arithematic operator-(+,-,*,/)\n2)- Concatenation Operator ( || )\n3)- Comparision Operator(= , != or <>)\n4)- Relational Operator-(> , < , >= , <= )\n5)- Logical Operator(AND , OR , NOT)\n6)- SPECIAL OPERATOR-\n            1)IN\n            2)NOT IN\n            3)BETWEEN\n            4)NOT BETWEEN\n            5)IS\n            6)NOT IS\n            7)LIKE\n            8)NOT LIKE",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Operators in SQL \n\n1)- Arithematic operator-(+,-,*,/)\n2)- Concatenation Operator ( || )\n3)- Comparision Operator(= , != or <>)\n4)- Relational Operator-(> , < , >= , <= )\n5)- Logical Operator(AND , OR , NOT)\n6)- SPECIAL OPERATOR-\n            1)IN\n            2)NOT IN\n            3)BETWEEN\n            4)NOT BETWEEN\n            5)IS\n            6)NOT IS\n            7)LIKE\n            8)NOT LIKE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4OC4LhWzLS2hHZTTytDe1",
