      "text": ">WAQTD names of the emp \n   if the emp has char 'A' as his second character.\n\nSELECT ENAME\nFROM EMP\nWHERE ENAME LIKE '_A%' ;\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ">WAQTD names of the emp \n   if the emp has char 'A' as his second character.\n\nSELECT ENAME\nFROM EMP\nWHERE ENAME LIKE '_A%' ;\n\n\n",
