      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783957060817,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) SINGLE ROW SUB-QUERY:-  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) SINGLE ROW SUB-QUERY:-  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NA0XIibZtBruMXIwR__o5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40988.4208883735,
      "y": 2793.0754358448053,
      "width": 1808.4947509765625,
      "height": 82.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1375524290,
      "version": 276,
      "versionNonce": 1667796894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783957164313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> If the sub query returns exactly 1 record /value we call it as Single Row Sub Query . \n> If it returns onyly one '1' value then we can use the normal operators Or the Special Operators to compare the values .",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> If the sub query returns exactly 1 record /value we call it as Single Row Sub Query . \n> If it returns onyly one '1' value then we can use the normal operators Or the Special Operators to compare the values .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yF-K9Vnv5dtY0znoZ4eZJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40945.1663795214,
      "y": 2945.132616467099,
      "width": 429.3358154296875,
      "height": 41.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976358494,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1951314782,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783957187586,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) MULTI ROW SUB-QUERY",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) MULTI ROW SUB-QUERY",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NbgKUnkUJzNenxl8R8Ue6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40991.81071696622,
      "y": 3010.6690601676128,
      "width": 1352.6993408203125,
      "height": 165.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2016166146,
      "version": 279,
      "versionNonce": 1218680770,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783957290737,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ">If the sub query returns more than 1 records /value we call it as Multi Row Sub Query.\n>If it returns more than 1 value then we cannot use the normal operators ,We have to use \nonly SPECIAL OPERATORS to compare the values. \n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ">If the sub query returns more than 1 records /value we call it as Multi Row Sub Query.\n>If it returns more than 1 value then we cannot use the normal operators ,We have to use \nonly SPECIAL OPERATORS to compare the values. \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AlBYvYX_0byPPcJw2LUDa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40961.56114408555,
      "y": 3215.212151075467,
      "width": 126.6119384765625,
      "height": 41.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
