      "updated": 1784561454785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Number of rows in the result table :- will be quivalent to the product of number of rows present\n                                                                                    in the both of the tables .\n\nNUMBER OF ROWS = NUMBER OF ROWS T1 X NUMBER OF ROWS T2\n                                                = 3 X 3\n                                                 = 9 ROWS",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Number of rows in the result table :- will be quivalent to the product of number of rows present\n                                                                                    in the both of the tables .\n\nNUMBER OF ROWS = NUMBER OF ROWS T1 X NUMBER OF ROWS T2\n                                                = 3 X 3\n                                                 = 9 ROWS",
