      "text": "Example :- \n  CREATE TABLE PRODUCT \n { PID Number(2) Primary Key\n    PNAME Varchar(10) ,\n    PRICE NUmber(7,2) check(Price > 0) \n    CID Number(2) ,\n    CONSTRAINT CID_FK FOREIGN KEY(CID) REFERENCES CUSTOMER(CID) \n    \n }; ",
